---
// Hauptinhalt Kita St. Wendel — Willkommen, Strip, Angebot, Pädagogik, Tagesablauf, Verpflegung
---

<!-- WILLKOMMEN -->
<section class="astro-kwe-welcome astro-kwe-sec">
  <div class="astro-kwe-welcome__in">
    <p class="astro-kwe-eyebrow-sm" style="text-align:center">Herzlich willkommen</p>
    <h2 class="astro-kwe-welcome__h2">Eine Kita, die Kinder als Sch&ouml;pf&shy;ungen Gottes sieht</h2>
    <p class="astro-kwe-welcome__text">Jedes Kind hat besondere Begabungen, die es zu entdecken und zu f&ouml;rdern gilt. R&auml;ume, Material und Alltag in unserer Kita sind darauf ausgerichtet, Kinder in ihrer Eigenaktivit&auml;t zu unterst&uuml;tzen und ihre Neugier zu n&auml;hren.</p>
    <blockquote class="astro-kwe-welcome__motto">Kinder brauchen Wurzeln, die sie halten, und Fl&uuml;gel, die sie tragen.</blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- INFO STRIP -->
<section class="astro-kwe-strip astro-kwe-sec" id="astro-kwe-strip">
  <div class="astro-kwe-strip__in">
    <div class="astro-kwe-strip__item">
      <div class="astro-kwe-strip__icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-strip__label">Alter</div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-strip__value">1 &ndash; 6 Jahre</div>
    </div>
    <div class="astro-kwe-strip__item">
      <div class="astro-kwe-strip__icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-strip__label">Gruppen</div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-strip__value">2 Krippe + 2 KiGa</div>
    </div>
    <div class="astro-kwe-strip__item">
      <div class="astro-kwe-strip__icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13S3 17 3 10a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-strip__label">Ort</div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-strip__value">Frankfurt-Sachsenhausen</div>
    </div>
    <div class="astro-kwe-strip__item">
      <div class="astro-kwe-strip__icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 8h1a4 4 0 0 1 0 8h-1"/><path d="M2 8h16v9a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H6a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8z"/><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="4"/><line x1="10" y1="1" x2="10" y2="4"/><line x1="14" y1="1" x2="14" y2="4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-strip__label">Verpflegung</div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-strip__value">Frisch gekochtes Mittagessen</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BETREUUNGSANGEBOT -->
<section class="astro-kwe-konzept astro-kwe-sec" id="astro-kwe-angebot">
  <div class="astro-kwe-konzept__in">
    <div class="astro-kwe-konzept__text">
      <p class="astro-kwe-eyebrow-sm">Unser Angebot</p>
      <h2 class="astro-kwe-konzept__h2">Krippe und Kindergarten</h2>
      <p>Wir betreuen in der Kita St. Wendel Kinder ab 1 Jahr in zwei Krippengruppen und Kinder von 3 bis 6 Jahren in zwei Kindergartengruppen. Unser p&auml;dagogisches Konzept orientiert sich am Situationsansatz und den Prinzipien von Emmi Pikler.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="astro-kwe-konzept__cards">
      <div class="astro-kwe-konzept__card"><h4>Krippe</h4><p>2 Gruppen, je 10 Pl&auml;tze, f&uuml;r Kinder ab 1 Jahr. Eingewöhnung nach Berliner Modell.</p></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-konzept__card"><h4>Kindergarten</h4><p>2 Gruppen, je 22 Pl&auml;tze, f&uuml;r Kinder von 3 bis 6 Jahren. Situationsansatz und offene Angebote.</p></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-konzept__card"><h4>Ganztagsbetreuung</h4><p>Montags bis freitags von 7:30 bis 17:00 Uhr, frisch gekochtes Mittagessen.</p></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-konzept__card"><h4>Sakralisches Leben</h4><p>Kirchenjahr und Feste als Teil des Alltags &ndash; durch Gebete, Lieder und Rituale.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PÄDAGOGIK -->
<section class="astro-kwe-paed astro-kwe-sec" id="astro-kwe-paed">
  <div class="astro-kwe-paed__in">
    <div class="astro-kwe-paed__head">
      <p class="astro-kwe-eyebrow-sm">P&auml;dagogisches Profil</p>
      <h2 class="astro-kwe-paed__h2">Unser Ansatz</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="astro-kwe-paed__grid">
      <div class="astro-kwe-paed__card">
        <p class="astro-kwe-paed__card-tag">Kindergarten</p>
        <h3 class="astro-kwe-paed__card-h3">Situationsansatz</h3>
        <p>Im Kindergarten orientieren wir uns am Situationsansatz. Kinder erkunden die Welt durch Spiel, Projekte und t&auml;gliche Herausforderungen, die aus ihrem Leben gegriffen sind.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-paed__card">
        <p class="astro-kwe-paed__card-tag">Krippe</p>
        <h3 class="astro-kwe-paed__card-h3">Pikler-P&auml;dagogik</h3>
        <p>In der Krippe arbeiten wir angelehnt an das p&auml;dagogische Konzept von Emmi Pikler. Achtsamkeit, der sanfte Umgang mit den J&uuml;ngsten und das eigenst&auml;ndige Erkunden stehen im Mittelpunkt.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="astro-kwe-paed__highlights">
      <div class="astro-kwe-paed__hl">
        <div class="astro-kwe-paed__hl-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="22" height="22"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="astro-kwe-paed__hl-title">GUK &amp; METACOM</p>
          <p class="astro-kwe-paed__hl-text">Geb&auml;rden-unterst&uuml;tzte Kommunikation und das METACOM-Symbolsystem werden im gesamten Alltag eingesetzt &ndash; f&uuml;r alle Kinder, unabh&auml;ngig von sprachlichem Entwicklungsstand.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-paed__hl">
        <div class="astro-kwe-paed__hl-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="22" height="22"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="astro-kwe-paed__hl-title">Qualit&auml;tsmanagement</p>
          <p class="astro-kwe-paed__hl-text">Wir arbeiten nach den Qualit&auml;tsma&szlig;st&auml;ben Q-iTa des Bistums Limburg, dem KTK-G&uuml;tesiegel und werden regelm&auml;&szlig;ig extern evaluiert.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-paed__hl">
        <div class="astro-kwe-paed__hl-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="22" height="22"><path d="M22 17H2a3 3 0 0 0 3-3V9a7 7 0 0 1 14 0v5a3 3 0 0 0 3 3zm-8.27 4a2 2 0 0 1-3.46 0"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="astro-kwe-paed__hl-title">Religionsp&auml;dagogik</p>
          <p class="astro-kwe-paed__hl-text">Im gemeinsamen Erleben von Br&auml;uchen und Festen im Kirchenjahr bringen wir den Kindern das Christentum nahe. Durch Gebete, Lieder und Rituale wird Glaube erfahrbar.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TAGESABLAUF (tabbed: Krippe / Kiga) -->
<section class="astro-kwe-tages astro-kwe-sec" id="astro-kwe-tagesablauf">
  <div class="astro-kwe-tages__in">
    <div class="astro-kwe-tages__head">
      <p class="astro-kwe-eyebrow-sm">Ein Tag bei uns</p>
      <h2 class="astro-kwe-tages__h2">Tagesablauf in Krippe und Kindergarten</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="astro-kwe-tages__tabs" role="tablist">
      <button class="astro-kwe-tages__tab is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-panel="kwe-krippe">Krippe</button>
      <button class="astro-kwe-tages__tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-panel="kwe-kiga">Kindergarten</button>
    </div>
    <div class="astro-kwe-tages__panel is-active" id="kwe-krippe">
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">7:30 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Kita &ouml;ffnet &ndash; Ankommen und ruhiges Freispiel</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">8:30 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Ankommen in der Stammgruppe</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">9:00 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Morgenkreis</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">9:15 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Gemeinsames Fr&uuml;hst&uuml;ck</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">9:45 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Freispiel, p&auml;dagogische Angebote, Au&szlig;engel&auml;nde</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">11:30 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Mittagessen</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">12:00 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Schlaf- und Ruhezeit</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">14:00 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Freispiel, p&auml;dagogische Angebote</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">14:30 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Nachmittagssnack</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">15:00 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Freispiel, p&auml;dagogische Angebote, Abholzeit</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">17:00 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Kita schlie&szlig;t</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="astro-kwe-tages__panel" id="kwe-kiga">
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">7:30 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Kita &ouml;ffnet &ndash; Ankommen und ruhiges Freispiel</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">8:30 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Ankommen in der Stammgruppe</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">9:00 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Morgenkreis, gemeinsames Fr&uuml;hst&uuml;ck</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">9:45 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Freispiel, p&auml;dagogische Angebote, Projekte, Au&szlig;engel&auml;nde</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">12:00 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Mittagessen</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">12:30 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Ruhe, Entspannung, stille Besch&auml;ftigung</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">14:00 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Freispiel, p&auml;dagogische Angebote</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">15:00 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Nachmittagssnack</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">15:30 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Freispiel, Abholzeit</div></div>
      <div class="astro-kwe-tages__row"><div class="astro-kwe-tages__time">17:00 Uhr</div><div class="astro-kwe-tages__act">Kita schlie&szlig;t</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- VERPFLEGUNG -->
<section class="astro-kwe-verp astro-kwe-sec">
  <div class="astro-kwe-verp__in">
    <div class="astro-kwe-verp__text">
      <p class="astro-kwe-eyebrow-sm">Verpflegung</p>
      <h2 class="astro-kwe-verp__h2">Jeden Tag frisch gekocht</h2>
      <p class="astro-kwe-verp__p">Die Qualit&auml;t unserer Lebensmittel ist uns wichtig. Unsere K&ouml;chin kocht jeden Tag mit frischen Zutaten und setzt auf saisonale und regionale Produkte. Kinder d&uuml;rfen mitentscheiden und ihren Hunger selbst regulieren.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="astro-kwe-verp__img">
      <img src="/uploads/2024/05/kita-sw-essende-kinder.jpeg" alt="Kinder beim gemeinsamen Mittagessen in der Kita St. Wendel" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
/* WILLKOMMEN */
.astro-kwe-welcome { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #fff 0%, var(--bf-bg) 100%); padding: 72px 24px; }
.astro-kwe-welcome__in { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
.astro-kwe-welcome__h2 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 40px); font-weight: 700; color: var(--bf-ink); margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 1.2; }
.astro-kwe-welcome__text { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--bf-ink-60); margin: 0 0 24px; text-align: left; }
.astro-kwe-welcome__motto { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 19px; font-style: italic; color: var(--bf-accent); padding: 24px 32px; border-left: 3px solid var(--bf-gold); background: rgba(184,138,58,.06); border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; text-align: left; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }

/* STRIP */
.astro-kwe-strip { background: var(--bf-bg); padding: 48px 24px; }
.astro-kwe-strip__in { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.astro-kwe-strip__item { text-align: center; background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--bf-border); }
.astro-kwe-strip__icon { color: var(--bf-accent); margin-bottom: 8px; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
.astro-kwe-strip__label { font-family: 'Futura LT W01 Book', Futura, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--bf-ink-60); margin-bottom: 6px; }
.astro-kwe-strip__value { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 15px; color: var(--bf-ink); line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 700; }

/* KONZEPT */
.astro-kwe-konzept { background: var(--bf-bg); padding: 80px 24px; }
.astro-kwe-konzept__in { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: start; }
.astro-kwe-konzept__h2 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px); font-weight: 700; color: var(--bf-ink); margin: 0 0 16px; }
.astro-kwe-konzept__text p { font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--bf-ink-60); margin: 0; }
.astro-kwe-konzept__cards { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
.astro-kwe-konzept__card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--bf-border); border-radius: var(--bf-radius); padding: 18px 22px; border-left: 3px solid var(--bf-accent); }
.astro-kwe-konzept__card h4 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bf-ink); margin: 0 0 4px; }
.astro-kwe-konzept__card p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--bf-ink-60); margin: 0; }
@media (max-width: 760px) { .astro-kwe-konzept__in { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; } }

/* PÄDAGOGIK */
.astro-kwe-paed { background: #fff; padding: 80px 24px; }
.astro-kwe-paed__in { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
.astro-kwe-paed__head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 44px; }
.astro-kwe-paed__h2 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px); font-weight: 700; color: var(--bf-ink); margin: 0; }
.astro-kwe-paed__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 36px; }
.astro-kwe-paed__card { background: var(--bf-bg); border-radius: var(--bf-radius); padding: 28px 24px; }
.astro-kwe-paed__card-tag { font-family: 'Futura LT W01 Book', Futura, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--bf-accent); margin: 0 0 8px; }
.astro-kwe-paed__card-h3 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bf-ink); margin: 0 0 12px; }
.astro-kwe-paed__card p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--bf-ink-60); margin: 0; }
.astro-kwe-paed__highlights { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
.astro-kwe-paed__hl { display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start; background: var(--bf-bg); border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px 24px; }
.astro-kwe-paed__hl-icon { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 8px; background: #fff; color: var(--bf-accent); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1px solid var(--bf-border); flex-shrink: 0; }
.astro-kwe-paed__hl-title { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bf-ink); margin: 0 0 6px; }
.astro-kwe-paed__hl-text { font-size: 14px; color: var(--bf-ink-60); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0; }
@media (max-width: 640px) { .astro-kwe-paed__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

/* TAGESABLAUF */
.astro-kwe-tages { background: var(--bf-bg); padding: 80px 24px; }
.astro-kwe-tages__in { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
.astro-kwe-tages__head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; }
.astro-kwe-tages__h2 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px); font-weight: 700; color: var(--bf-ink); margin: 0; }
.astro-kwe-tages__tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.astro-kwe-tages__tab { padding: 9px 24px; border-radius: 22px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; border: 1.5px solid var(--bf-border); background: #fff; color: var(--bf-ink-60); transition: all .2s; }
.astro-kwe-tages__tab.is-active, .astro-kwe-tages__tab:hover { background: var(--bf-accent); color: #fff; border-color: var(--bf-accent); }
.astro-kwe-tages__panel { display: none; background: #fff; border-radius: var(--bf-radius); border: 1px solid var(--bf-border); overflow: hidden; }
.astro-kwe-tages__panel.is-active { display: block; }
.astro-kwe-tages__row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr; gap: 16px; padding: 11px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bf-border); align-items: start; }
.astro-kwe-tages__row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.astro-kwe-tages__time { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bf-accent); font-size: 13.5px; padding-top: 2px; }
.astro-kwe-tages__act { font-size: 14px; color: var(--bf-ink); line-height: 1.6; }
@media (max-width: 600px) { .astro-kwe-tages__row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; padding: 13px 20px; } }

/* VERPFLEGUNG */
.astro-kwe-verp { background: var(--bf-bg-alt); padding: 72px 24px; }
.astro-kwe-verp__in { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center; }
.astro-kwe-verp__h2 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px); font-weight: 700; color: var(--bf-ink); margin: 0 0 16px; }
.astro-kwe-verp__p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--bf-ink-60); line-height: 1.75; margin: 0; }
.astro-kwe-verp__img { border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 4/3; }
.astro-kwe-verp__img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
@media (max-width: 760px) { .astro-kwe-verp__in { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>

<script>
// Tagesablauf tabs
document.querySelectorAll('.astro-kwe-tages__tab').forEach(btn => {
  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const panelId = btn.dataset.panel;
    document.querySelectorAll('.astro-kwe-tages__tab').forEach(b => {
      b.classList.remove('is-active');
      b.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'false');
    });
    document.querySelectorAll('.astro-kwe-tages__panel').forEach(p => p.classList.remove('is-active'));
    btn.classList.add('is-active');
    btn.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'true');
    document.getElementById(panelId)?.classList.add('is-active');
  });
});
</script>
